---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';

const email = Astro.url.searchParams.get('email') ?? '';
const maskedEmail = email.replace(/^(.{2}).*(@.*)$/, '$1•••$2');
---

<Layout title="已发送">
  <main class="max-w-reading mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto">
      <header class="mb-6">
        <h1 class="text-2xl mb-2">查收邮箱</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
          我们给 <strong class="text-secondary">{maskedEmail || '你的邮箱'}</strong> 发了一封登录邮件。
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-md bg-bg-warm text-xs text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>打开邮箱，找到主题「登录全学科学习笔记」</li>
          <li>点击邮件里的「登录」按钮（或复制链接到浏览器）</li>
          <li>就自动登录回来了</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-quaternary mt-6 leading-relaxed">
        链接 10 分钟内有效。没收到？检查垃圾邮件；或 <a href="/login" class="text-accent-strategy">重新申请</a>。
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
